&lt;p&gt;We are Olsson. We engineer and design solutions that improve the world around us. As a company, we promise to always be responsive, transparent, and focused on results – for our people, our clients, and our company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a people-centric firm, so it’s no surprise our greatest asset is our people. The impact this creates is an environment that encourages our people to grow and be creative with their talents. This approach builds a culture that is uniquely Olsson. It allows us to grow our people as we grow our business. This, in turn, creates a lasting impact on the world around us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Olsson&#39;s Industrial team as a &lt;strong&gt;Process Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; and help deliver innovative solutions for clients across the agricultural processing, ethanol, food and beverage, renewable fuels, manufacturing, chemical, and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Process Engineer, you will play a key role in planning, designing, and optimizing industrial processes and systems. You will collaborate with multidisciplinary teams to develop safe, efficient, and cost-effective solutions for both greenfield and brownfield projects. This position offers opportunities to work directly with clients, contribute to technically challenging projects, and support the continued growth of Olsson&#39;s Industrial practice.&lt;/p&gt;
