&lt;li&gt;Perform process engineering calculations, including mass balances, energy balances, hydraulic calculations, and equipment sizing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evaluate industrial process systems including pumping, piping, heat transfer, utility systems, chemical feed systems, and material handling processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare technical reports, studies, cost estimates, and engineering documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with mechanical, piping, structural, electrical, instrumentation, and control system engineers to deliver integrated project solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support facility planning, process optimization, debottlenecking, and operational improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in process hazard reviews, safety evaluations, and risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with project planning, scope development, scheduling, budget management, and resource coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct field investigations, facility assessments, startup support, and commissioning activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate directly with clients to understand operational goals and develop practical engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review vendor drawings, equipment submittals, and contractor deliverables for technical compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business development efforts through proposals, client meetings, and technical presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers and contribute technical knowledge sharing across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
